  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowered and Equal Futures for Girls through Education in Southeast Asia 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports UNICEF to strengthen education systems across Southeast Asia and address gender based violence (GBV) by advancing gender transformative education. In Cambodia and Vietnam, at the school and community level, UNICEF implements whole school approaches to create safe, inclusive learning environments and empower the most marginalised girls with quality education and transferable life skills. At the system level, the program supports governments to strengthen education policies, curricula, and teaching practices that promote gender equality and prevent GBV. At the regional level, the program fosters cross border collaboration, evidence generation, and capacity building to advance gender transformative education and end school related GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
